Using nltk, I first tagged each sample with Part Of Speech (POS) Tags. POS tagging refers to the process of marking the corpus up with the grammatical tags denoting the part of speech (i.e. noun, pronoun, adjective, verb, adverb, etc.) for each word.

```
import nltk

