1. Hardware level
2. Virtualization
3. RTL level

### Hardware level

- (On-Target) Profiling FPGA Hardware: Power, Clocks, Temperature, Logic Utilization, HW Utilization (little patching required), Latency, Instantaneous throughput, accumulated throughput and power.
	+ Pros: obtain accurate power, temperature, and resource utilization measurements
	+ Cons: high resource utilization overhead.
